## Component 3: Nightly Scanner (2 hours)

### Implementation

**Update [scripts/nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py):**

```python
def scan_for_commitments():
    """Scan artifacts for new commitments"""
    from pathlib import Path
    import subprocess
    
    brain_path = Path(os.getenv("NUCLEAR_BRAIN_PATH"))
    artifacts_path = brain_path / "artifacts"
    
    # Scan for checklist items
    result = subprocess.run(
        ["rg", r"- \[ \]", str(artifacts_path), "--type", "md", "-n"],
        capture_output=True,
        text=True
    )
    
    for line in result.stdout.strip().split('\n'):
        if not line:
            continue
        
        # Parse: file:line:content
        parts = line.split(':', 2)
        if len(parts) == 3:
            file_path, line_num, content = parts
            description = content.strip().replace('- [ ]', '').strip()
            
            # Add to ledger if not already tracked
            _add_commitment_if_new(file_path, int(line_num), description, "checklist_item")
    
    # Update ages for all commitments
    _update_commitment_ages()
    
    print(f"✅ Commitment scan complete")

# Add to nightly agent run
if __name__ == "__main__":
    scan_for_commitments()
    # ... rest of nightly agent tasks
```

